&lt;p&gt;vulkan: fix gpu-visible host memory issues (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5833667476&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/30468&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/30468/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/30468&quot;&gt;#30468&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;vulkan: fix log spam if host pointer import fails&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;exclude MoltenVK from shared memory import&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;remove unreachable code, assert instead. Shorten warnings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;disable host memory buffer sharing on AMD due to amdgpu perf issue&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
